ARTICLE I — DEFINITIONS

1.1 "Software" means this software and associated documentation files,
    together with all copies, portions, and derivative works thereof.

1.2 "Holder" means any natural person or juridical person exercising,
    or seeking to exercise, permissions granted by this License.

1.3 "Addressee" means a Holder who is a natural person, of the age of
    majority in the Holder's jurisdiction, whose sex assigned at birth
    is male, and who presently identifies as male. Every other Holder —
    including, without limitation, every female Holder, every Holder
    below the age of majority, every juridical person (which, having no
    sex, cannot be an Addressee), and every natural person not described
    in the preceding sentence — is a "Non-Addressee."

1.4 "Femboy" means a male person who, of his own volition, expresses
    himself in a feminine style. Such expression is an exercise of
    personal liberty; it neither alters the person's legal sex nor
    implies any conclusion respecting sexual orientation or gender
    identity.

1.5 "Aspiration" means a sincere, inwardly held, and continuing
    intention of a Holder to become a qualified femboy, "qualified"
    being measured — without examination and without a model answer —
    by reference to: (a) self-acceptance; (b) sustained and sincere
    self-expression; (c) respect for the personhood and choices of
    others; and (d) the maintenance of physical and mental health.

